		Menu -> Head Office -> E-Module -> ATM Dispute Report

	IMP :
		- folder atm_dispute should be present at path "/spool/Import/"
		- this directory contain another folder with name yyyymm, which in turn contains another
			 date wise directories as yyyy-mm-dd
		- these sudirectories again contain one or two directory/directories depend on refund
			 record (cycle1 and/or cycle2)
		- all the records in cycle1 and/or cycle2 directory are supposed to recieve refund.
		- single batch for all records in parent directory (i.e directory yyyymm)
			but cotra will be cycle wise
		- NOTE : This window is allowed to head office only.

	 IMPORT_PATH_ATM "/spool/Import/atm_dispute"
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

	view :
		- Choice is given with ATM/IMPS/UPI/BBPS options, user has to select one option
		- then using year and month entered, program starts parsing directory of the same name
				as value entered. (name = yyyymm)
		- if directory is present, then parse it for available records and create a cycle wise
			scroll, in which amount will get credited to accounts mentioned in records and total
			amount of single cycle get debited from NPCI ecommerce GL account.

